WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.635
-Guys, it can be hard
to say goodbye,

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.537
but sometimes you have to,
and there are a few things

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.206
I'd like to say goodbye to
right now.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:08.107
It's time for "Go On, Git."

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:09.275
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:12.512
-♪ Go on, git, go on, git ♪

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:18.118
♪ Go on, go on, go on, git ♪

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.019
[ Western guitar twanging ]

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:21.921
-Whoa.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:26.493
♪♪

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:31.263
-Go on, git,
election touch screens.

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:34.267
Thanks for being
the iPads we needed...

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:37.303
and the TV no one asked for.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.071
You served this country well,

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:42.108
but now it's time to git back
to the CNN supply closet

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.377
until 2024.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:47.480
May you live to be pinched
and poked another day.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:51.384
'Til then, breaking news,
you better go on to the git.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.019
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:59.825
♪♪

00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:03.896
Go on, git, mahogany.

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:05.230
Oh, you think you're --

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:06.733
'cause you're a
straight-grained,

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.768
reddish-brown timber
with a range

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:11.537
that extends from South America
to North America

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:13.673
that you get to have
a four-syllable,

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.609
hoity-toity name
like "mahogany"?!

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.878
Here's a new name for you.

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:21.147
Tree.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.183
Don't like that one?
Here's another one.

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:24.750
Wood.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.286
Wham bam! Go on, git!

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:29.188
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:33.893
♪♪

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:38.931
Go on, git,
daylight savings time.

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:41.067
Sure, it's fun
to switch things up,

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.136
but you know what else is fun?

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:45.204
Daylight!

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:47.707
The only things
I need less light for

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:50.476
are movie theaters
and laser tag.

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:53.246
And both of those
are on COVID hold.

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:55.815
Or HOVID, as I call it.

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:59.719
Besides, I'm tired of adjusting
my oven clock at your whim.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:03.723
So why don't you spring forward,
fall back, and go on, git!

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:05.424
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.424 --> 00:02:11.530
♪♪

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:12.599
[ Spit ]

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:14.934
[ Ding! ]

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:19.005
Go on, git...
anteaters, ya big weirdos.

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:22.208
You look -- You look like
someone stuck a Dirt Devil

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:25.244
onto a dog's face and said,
"Hope you like ants."

00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:27.313
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:30.116
Well, I reckon
God created you for a reason,

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:31.751
and that reason
was for me to say,

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.386
"Thank you for eatin'
all the ants."

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:36.355
I do dislike ants.

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:37.857
You can stay, anteaters,

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:39.892
you weird-looking,
cone-faced beavers.

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:41.394
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:43.629
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:49.068
♪♪

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:53.306
Go on, git, old Hotmail address.

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:55.408
You were the first
e-mail address I ever had,

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:59.312
but you've outlived your
usefulness by about 20 years.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:02.614
The only e-mails you get now are
Bed Bath &amp; Beyond coupons,

00:03:02.614 --> 00:03:06.085
links to adult websites,
and notifications from Myspace.

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:10.757
Now, go on, git,
KoolDude555@hotmail.com,

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:13.926
and don't let the barn door
hit you in the backside.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:16.795
Well, it's hard to see 'em go,
but I'm glad

00:03:16.795 --> 00:03:19.732
that I got it all out of my
system. We'll be right back.

